---
title: "refund (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_refunded: endTime < now <= refundEndTime
    q_check_period --> q_revert_timing: outside refund period
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotActive
    q_check_refunded --> q_calc_refund: position.hasRefunded == false
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_dup: already refunded
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_calc_refund --> q_update_position: refundAmount = position.investedCapital
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.hasRefunded = true, position.investedCapital = 0
    q_update_total --> q_transfer: totalCapitalInvested -= refundAmount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, refundAmount), emit Refunded

    note right of q_calc_refund
        INV-001: each investor can refund at most once
        INV-002: refund returns full investedCapital amount
        INV-003: totalCapitalInvested decreases by exact refund amount
        INV-004: refund only available during refund period window
    end note
